e is UTC, today is 2026-09-07, and an open invoice INV-2 has due date 2026-09-01","id":"AC-1.2","level":"api","then":"the response does not contain INV-2","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices is called with a valid staff token"},{"given":"business timezone is UTC+2, the current UTC time is 2026-09-07T23:30Z (local date 2026-09-08), threshold is 7, and an open invoice INV-3 has due date 2026-09-01","id":"AC-1.3","level":"api","then":"the response contains INV-3","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices is called with a valid staff token"},{"given":"the threshold setting is changed to 10 and today is 2026-09-10, with an open invoice INV-4 due 2026-09-01","id":"AC-1.4","level":"api","then":"INV-4 is not returned; on 2026-09-11 it is returned","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices is called"}],"ears":"When an authenticated staff user requests the overdue list, the invoice reminders API shall return every invoice that is not paid or closed and whose due date plus the configured overdue threshold (default 7 days) is on or before today's date in the configured business timezone.","id":"REQ-1","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","Q-2","Q-6","ASM-1","ASM-2","ASM-3","ASM-9"],"stability":0.85},{"acceptance":[{"given":"invoice INV-5 is 30 days past its due date and its status is paid","id":"AC-2.1","level":"api","then":"INV-5 is not in the response","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices is called with a valid staff token"},{"given":"invoice INV-6 is in the overdue list and its status is then changed to closed in the invoice table","id":"AC-2.2","level":"api","then":"INV-6 is no longer in the response","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices is called again"}],"ears":"If an invoice has a paid or closed status in the existing invoice data, then the invoice reminders API shall leave it out of the overdue list whatever its due date.","id":"REQ-2","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-4","I-1","ASM-1"],"stability":0.9},{"acceptance":[{"given":"a snapshot of all invoice table rows is taken, and some of those invoices are overdue","id":"AC-3.1","level":"api","then":"every invoice table row is unchanged compared with the snapshot","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices and GET /api/invoices/{id} are called for an overdue invoice"}],"ears":"The invoice reminders API shall work out overdue status when it is queried and shall not write any overdue flag or status to invoice records.","id":"REQ-3","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-6","ASM-2"],"stability":0.85},{"acceptance":[{"given":"today is 2026-09-08 (business timezone) and open invoice INV-1 for customer 'Rye & Co' with amount 120.50 is due 2026-09-01","id":"AC-4.1","level":"api","then":"the INV-1 entry has invoiceNumber INV-1, customer 'Rye & Co', amount 120.50, dueDate 2026-09-01 and daysOverdue 7","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices is called"}],"ears":"The invoice reminders API shall return, for each invoice in the overdue list, its invoice number, customer name, amount, due date and days overdue, where days overdue is the number of calendar days from the due date to today in the business timezone.","id":"REQ-4","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","I-6","ASM-4","ASM-9"],"stability":0.8},{"acceptance":[{"given":"customer A has overdue invoices INV-10 and INV-11 and customer B has overdue invoice INV-12","id":"AC-5.1","level":"api","then":"the response contains exactly INV-10 and INV-11","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices?customerId={A} is called"},{"given":"customer C has no overdue invoices","id":"AC-5.2","level":"api","then":"the response is 200 with an empty list","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices?customerId={C} is called"}],"ears":"When the overdue list is requested with a customer filter, the invoice reminders API shall return only overdue invoices belonging to that customer.","id":"REQ-5","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5"],"stability":0.85},{"acceptance":[{"given":"overdue invoices with days overdue 7, 30, 31, 60, 61, 90 and 91","id":"AC-6.1","level":"api","then":"only the invoices with 31 and 60 days overdue are returned","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices?daysOverdue=31-60 is called"},{"given":"the same invoices","id":"AC-6.2","level":"api","then":"only the invoice with 91 days overdue is returned","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices?daysOverdue=91+ is called"},{"given":"customer A has overdue invoices at 10 and 45 days and customer B has one at 12 days","id":"AC-6.3","level":"api","then":"only customer A's 10-day invoice is returned","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices?customerId={A}&daysOverdue=7-30 is called"},{"given":"any data","id":"AC-6.4","level":"api","then":"the response is 400 and names the allowed bucket values","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices?daysOverdue=5-9 is called"}],"ears":"When the overdue list is requested with a days-overdue bucket filter of 7–30, 31–60, 61–90 or 91+, the invoice reminders API shall return only overdue invoices whose days overdue falls inside that bucket, bounds included.","id":"REQ-6","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","ASM-4","ASM-5"],"stability":0.6},{"acceptance":[{"given":"no Authorization credentials","id":"AC-7.1","level":"api","then":"each response is 401 with no invoice or customer fields in the body, and no email is sent to the email provider","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices, GET /api/invoices/{id} and POST /api/invoices/{id}/reminders are each called"},{"given":"an expired staff token","id":"AC-7.2","level":"api","then":"the response is 401","when":"GET /api/overdue-invoices is called"}],"ears":"If a request to the overdue list, invoice detail or send-reminder endpoint has no valid staff authentication under the existing API's authentication scheme, then the invoice reminders API shall reject it with HTTP 401 and return no invoice or customer data.","id":"REQ-7","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-1"],"stability":0.9},{"acceptance":[{"given":"overdue invoice INV-1 (amount 120.50, due 2026-09-01) belongs to a customer with email billing@rye.example","id":"AC-8.1","level":"api","then":"the response is 2xx and the email provider (stubbed) receives exactly one send request to billing@rye.example whose body contains 'INV-1', '120.50' and '2026-09-01'","when":"POST /api/invoices/INV-1/reminders is called with a valid staff token"}],"ears":"When an authenticated staff user submits a send-reminder request for an overdue invoice whose customer has an email address, the invoice reminders API shall send one reminder email through the email provider to that customer's email address, and the email shall contain the invoice number, amount and due date.","id":"REQ-8","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","Q-5","Q-7","ASM-6","ASM-7","ASM-8","ASM-16"],"stability":0.85},{"acceptance":[{"given":"overdue invoice INV-20 belongs to a customer whose email field is empty","id":"AC-9.1","level":"api","then":"the response is 422 with a message saying the customer has no email address, and the email provider stub receives no request","when":"POST /api/invoices/INV-20/reminders is called with a valid staff token"},{"given":"invoice INV-21 has status paid","id":"AC-9.2","level":"api","then":"the response is 409 saying the invoice is not overdue, and the email provider stub receives no request","when":"POST /api/invoices/INV-21/reminders is called with a valid staff token"}],"ears":"If a send-reminder request is for an invoice whose customer record has no email address, or for an invoice that is not currently overdue, then the invoice reminders API shall reject the request with an error that states the reason and shall not call the email provider.","id":"REQ-9","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-7","ASM-7","I-2"],"stability":0.75},{"acceptance":[{"given":"staff user 'maria' is authenticated and INV-1 is overdue with a valid customer email, and the provider stub accepts the send","id":"AC-10.1","level":"api","then":"a reminder attempt row exists for INV-1 with sender 'maria', a timestamp within 5 seconds of the request time, and status 'sent'","when":"POST /api/invoices/INV-1/reminders is called"},{"given":"two reminders were sent for INV-1 more than 60 seconds apart by 'maria' and then 'tom'","id":"AC-10.2","level":"api","then":"the reminder history has two entries with senders 'maria' and 'tom' and their own timestamps","when":"GET /api/invoices/INV-1 is called"}],"ears":"When the invoice reminders API sends a reminder to the email provider, the invoice reminders API shall record a reminder attempt for that invoice with the sending staff user, a UTC timestamp, and a delivery status of sent or failed.","id":"REQ-10","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","Q-3"],"stability":0.85},{"acceptance":[{"given":"overdue invoice INV-1 and the provider stub responds with an error 'invalid recipient'","id":"AC-11.1","level":"api","then":"the response is 502 including 'invalid recipient', a reminder attempt row for INV-1 has status 'failed' and reason 'invalid recipient', and GET /api/overdue-invoices still contains INV-1","when":"POST /api/invoices/INV-1/reminders is called with a valid staff token"},{"given":"the provider stub does not respond within the configured send timeout","id":"AC-11.2","level":"api","then":"the attempt is recorded as 'failed' with a reason that says it timed out","when":"POST /api/invoices/INV-1/reminders is called"}],"ears":"If the email provider returns an error when a reminder is sent, then the invoice reminders API shall record the attempt as failed with the provider's reason, return an error response to the staff user, and keep the invoice on the overdue list.","id":"REQ-11","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","Q-3","Q-8"],"stability":0.85},{"acceptance":[{"given":"reminder attempt R-1 for INV-1 has status 'sent' and provider message id 'msg-1'","id":"AC-12.1","level":"api","then":"the response is 2xx, R-1 has status 'failed' and reason 'mailbox full', and INV-1 is still in GET /api/overdue-invoices","when":"POST /api/email-events is called with a correctly signed bounce event for 'msg-1' with reason 'mailbox full'"},{"given":"reminder attempt R-1 has status 'sent'","id":"AC-12.2","level":"api","then":"the response is 401 and R-1 still has status 'sent'","when":"POST /api/email-events is called with a bounce event for 'msg-1' whose signature is missing or invalid"},{"given":"no reminder attempt has provider message id 'msg-unknown'","id":"AC-12.3","level":"api","then":"the response is 2xx and no reminder attempt row changes","when":"a correctly signed bounce event for 'msg-unknown' is posted"}],"ears":"When the email provider reports a bounce for a reminder that was recorded as sent, the invoice reminders API shall change that reminder attempt's status to failed and store the bounce reason, provided the report passes the provider's signature check.","id":"REQ-12","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","Q-8","ASM-6"],"stability":0.65},{"acceptance":[{"given":"INV-1 is overdue with a valid customer email","id":"AC-13.1","level":"api","then":"the first returns 2xx, the second returns 409, the provider stub receives exactly one send request, and exactly one reminder attempt row exists for INV-1","when":"two POST /api/invoices/INV-1/reminders requests are sent 1 second apart"},{"given":"a reminder for INV-1 was accepted 61 seconds ago","id":"AC-13.2","level":"api","then":"the response is 2xx, a second email is sent and a second attempt row is recorded","when":"POST /api/invoices/INV-1/reminders is called again"},{"given":"a reminder for INV-1 was accepted 5 seconds ago","id":"AC-13.3","level":"api","then":"the request is accepted and an email is sent","when":"POST /api/invoices/INV-2/reminders is called for a different overdue invoice"}],"ears":"If a second send-reminder request for the same invoice arrives within 60 seconds of an earlier accepted one, then the invoice reminders API shall reject it with HTTP 409, shall not call the email provider, and shall not record another reminder attempt.","id":"REQ-13","op":"ADDED","sources":["Q-5","ASM-13"],"stability":0.7},{"acceptance":[{"given":"INV-1 has attempts: sent by 'maria' at 09:00, and failed by 'tom' at 10:00 with reason 'mailbox full'","id":"AC-14.1","level":"api","then":"the response has amount, dueDate, overdue=true and a history of 2 entries, the first being tom/10:00/failed/'mailbox full' and the second maria/09:00/sent with no reason","when":"GET /api/invoices/INV-1 is called with a valid staff token"},{"given":"invoice id 'does-not-exist'","id":"AC-14.2","level":"api","then":"the response is 404","when":"GET /api/invoices/does-not-exist is called"}],"ears":"When an authenticated staff user requests an invoice's detail, the invoice reminders API shall return the invoice number, customer, amount, due date, whether it is overdue, and its reminder history newest first, where each entry shows the sender, timestamp, delivery status and failure reason if there is one.","id":"REQ-14","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-4","I-7","Q-3"],"stability":0.8},{"acceptance":[{"given":"a staff user is signed in and 3 overdue invoices exist for 2 customers","id":"AC-15.1","level":"manual","then":"the table shows only that customer's invoices in that bucket, with all five columns and a 'Send reminder' button on each row","when":"the user opens the overdue list screen, picks one customer in the customer filter and then the 7–30 bucket"},{"given":"the email provider stub is set to delay 3 seconds and then fail with 'invalid recipient'","id":"AC-15.2","level":"manual","then":"the button is disabled until the request ends, only one request reaches the API, and the row then shows a failure message containing 'invalid recipient' while the invoice stays in the table","when":"the user clicks 'Send reminder' on a row and clicks it again straight away"}],"ears":"The overdue list screen shall show the overdue invoices in a table with invoice number, customer, amount, due date and days overdue, along with a customer filter, a days-overdue bucket filter, and a 'Send reminder' button on every row that stays disabled while its request is in progress and shows the success or failure result when it ends.","id":"REQ-15","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","I-5",